### Create a device
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Modem Tehran-01", "ipAddress": "10.0.0.11", "type": "MODEM", "monitoringEnabled": true }

### List devices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices?page=0&size=20

### Get / update / delete
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/1

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Modem Tehran-01 (renamed)", "ipAddress": "10.0.0.11", "type": "MODEM" }

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/1

### Enable / disable monitoring
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/1/monitoring
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enabled": false }

### Request an async ping (202 + operation). Repeat with the same key => 200 + same operation, no new ping
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/1/pings
Idempotency-Key: demo-0001

### Poll an operation (use the id from the previous response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pings/{{operationId}}

### Ping history of a device
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/1/pings?limit=20

### Monitoring summary (availability, latency stats, recent operations)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/1/monitor?window=50

### --- Failure demos (mock probe behaviour by IP range) ---
### 192.0.2.x -> device DOWN (conclusive)   198.51.100.x -> probe hangs => TIMED_OUT   203.0.113.x -> probe error => FAILED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "hangs", "ipAddress": "198.51.100.7", "type": "RADIO" }